+Overview
+xRHEA Farming Boost allows users to lock xRHEA tokens in exchange for boosted incentive rewards on their
+farm APYs
+. The longer the lock-up period, the greater the boost — up to a maximum of 6 months.
+xRHEA Farming Boost
+interface with boost ratio range and lock-up period up to 6 months
