+How to stake xRHEA for farming boost: Step by Step walkthrough
+Step 1: Go to
+https://app.rhea.finance/stake
+and connect your wallet
+Step 2: Click Farming Boost:
+Step 3: Choose RHEA or xRHEA:
+Stake requires minimum of 1.7 RHEA/xRHEA
+Step 4: Pick Boost Ratio Range based on your Lock time.
+Lock-up period from 1~6 month
+Step 4.1: If you hover to the Boosted ratio text, there will be a quick preview pop-up of your Boosted Farm APYs based on Stake Amount and Lock time of xRHEA
+Step 5: Click Stake and you're done!
+Step 6: you head over to the
+farms section
+on Liquidity tab, you can now see your boosted APY figures under the APYs.
